  "description": "All information on this page is specific to the Titan V3 - V3 frames were produced in 2019-2021 and are identifiable by the 31.6mm seat post. If you are seeking information for Titan V3.2 frames released in March 2022, and identifiable by the 30.9mm seat post. Please click here.\nThe Banshee Titan V3 is an entirely new, ground up, no compromise, 155mm travel 29er designed to tackle the hardest enduro days. Don’t be fooled by the fact it doesn’t have huge amounts of rear travel. It will climb and handle far better than the cumbersome competition, and dominate when pointed downhill.\nThe suspension is incredibly supple off the top due to optimized leverage curve and zero friction linkage to achieve maximum traction . As you ride faster, harder and the trail gets rougher the progression and characteristics of the linkage and stiffness of the frame really come into their own with huge amounts of confidence inspiring control.\nPrepare to grin manically when charging down through technical, fast, steep, and fun descents. Are you brave enough to explore your personal limits, because the Titan will take you there and encourage you to go further and faster than you imagined possible.",
